        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "どうぐを　なげつけて　こうげきする。\nなげる　もちものに　よって　わざの\nいりょくと　こうかは　かわる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "도구를 내던져서 공격한다.\n던질 물건에 따라 기술의\n위력과 효과가 바뀐다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Le lanceur envoie l’objet qu’il tient sur l’ennemi.\nLa puissance et les effets dépendent de l’objet.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Der Anwender wirft sein Item auf das Ziel.\nDie Kraft und die Wirkung hängen vom\njeweiligen Item ab.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Débil descarga eléctrica que se lanza contra el\nobjetivo y causa parálisis si es certera.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Chi la usa lancia il suo strumento addosso\nal nemico. La forza e l’effetto dipendono\ndallo strumento.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The user flings its held item at the target\nto attack. This move’s power and effects\ndepend on the item.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "持たせた　道具を\n素早く　投げつけて　攻撃する。\n道具で　威力と　効果が　かわる。",
